  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Programm EU/North America - Global issues and regional perspectives</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Regionalprogramm EU/Nordamerika - Globale Fragen und regionale Perspektiven</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Das Projekt umfasst Aktivit&#xe4;ten in Berlin, Br&#xfc;ssel, Istanbul, Thessaloniki + Washington DC, die regionalen + globalen Dialog zur &#xf6;kologisch-sozialen Transformation, zur Verteidigung von Menschenrechten + Demokratie, Geschlechtergerechtigkeit sowie Frieden + Sicherheit f&#xf6;rdern.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project covers activities in Berlin, Brussels, Istanbul, Thessaloniki and Washington DC, that contribute to a regional and global dialogue on an ecological and social transformation, the defense of human rights and democracy, gender equality as well as peace and security.</narrative>
  </description>
